              "name": "targetJobDescription",
              "value": "Job Title: Software Engineer Intern  Role Overview: We are looking for a passionate, detail-oriented Software Engineer Intern to join our engineering team. In this role, you will work alongside senior engineers to design, build, and deploy scalable web applications and features. You will contribute across the full software development lifecycle—from brainstorming ideas to writing clean code and testing deployments.  Key Responsibilities: - Collaborating with cross-functional teams to design and build responsive front-end user interfaces and robust back-end APIs. - Writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code using modern web development frameworks. - Troubleshooting, debugging, and optimizing web applications to ensure maximum performance and cross-device compatibility. - Participating in regular code reviews, agile sprints, and technical team brainstorming sessions.  Required Skills & Qualifications: - Solid foundation in computer science principles, data structures, algorithms, and object-oriented programming. - Hands-on experience or project exposure to Full-Stack web development (specifically React, Node.js, and JavaScript). - Strong understanding of relational and non-relational database architectures (e.g., SQL, MongoDB, MySQL). - Familiarity with version control workflows using Git and GitHub. - Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and collaborative communication skills.",
              "type": "string"
            }
